      "exercise": "820",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $2\\sqrt{3}$；b) $3\\sqrt{2}$；c) $5\\sqrt{2}$；d) $4\\sqrt{3}$；e) $5\\sqrt{5}$；f) $6\\sqrt{3}$；g) $11\\sqrt{3}$；h) $13\\sqrt{5}$。\n把被开方数写成一个完全平方数与另一个非负数的积，再提出完全平方数的平方根。例如 $845=13^2\\times5$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "exercise": "821",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $\\sqrt{6}$；b) $2\\sqrt{5}$；c) $-\\sqrt{3}$；d) $-\\sqrt{11}$；e) $10\\sqrt{2}$；f) $-6\\sqrt{2}$。\n原式前的负号保留在根号外。例如 $-0.05\\sqrt{28800}=-0.05\\times120\\sqrt{2}=-6\\sqrt{2}$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": []
