    {
      "exercise": "822",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $\\sqrt{490}$；b) $\\sqrt{75}$；c) $\\sqrt{150}$；d) $\\sqrt{500}$；e) $\\sqrt{24}$；f) $\\sqrt{6}$。\n正因数移入根号时要平方，例如 $6\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}=\\sqrt{6^2\\times\\frac{2}{3}}=\\sqrt{24}$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": []
